# Route: guide 4 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 16 to 17, 14
# quests, 0.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Orgrimmar): near Orgrimmar -> Orgrimmar -> near Orgrimmar -> Orgrimmar
# -> near Orgrimmar.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Halikor's Hoof (96877; Halikor
# 12).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 2751 Barbaric
# Battlements; 2752 On Iron Pauldrons; 2753 Trampled Under Foot; 2754 Horns of
# Frenzy; 2755 Joys of Omosh; 2756 The Old Ways; 2757 Booty Bay or Bust!; 5301
# The Art of the Armorsmith; 5302 The Way of the Weaponsmith; 6608 You Too
# Good.; 6611 To Gadgetzan You Go!; 96874 This Is Spinal Axe; 96875 Beasts of
# Thunder Ridge.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Necklace Recovery, Take 2 (2284), Rig Wars (2841), Rig
# Wars (2841), The Royal Rescue (4003), For The Horde! (4974), Returning the
# Lost Satchel (5724), Hidden Enemies (5728), Hidden Enemies (5728), Slaying
# the Beast (5761), Slaying the Beast (5761), Changing Tastes (95697),
# Changing Tastes (95697).

